@startuml
title SA-03 — Target main flow
caption Commercial v1 customer and merchant journey | PRD F01–F08
start
:Verify account and load workspace;
if (Standard order?) then (yes)
 :Choose fixed items, fulfilment and time;
 :Revalidate quantity, cost and availability;
 :Merchant accepts Cash or verifies DuitNow;
 :Prepare and hand off or handle incident;
else (event)
 :Submit event details;
 :Merchant assesses and quotes;
 :Customer accepts and pays deposit and balance;
 :Setup, teardown, inspect and settle extras;
endif
:Show owned status and derive records for reports;
stop
@enduml
